<%--
============================================================
MEMBER   : IT26101136 - [Name]
MODULE   : Shared UI
FILE     : search-bar.jspf
WHAT IT DOES (simple words): Shows the shared search bar block.
REAL-LIFE EXAMPLE: Shared signs help everyone find their way around the school.
OOP USED : Not applicable (shared presentation)
CRUD     : Displays existing data; does not save records
============================================================
--%>
<%-- This block shows search bar. The including page controller supplies this block through model attributes. --%>
<form class="ds-search-bar" method="get"><label for="page-search">Search</label><input id="page-search" type="search" name="q" value="<c:out value='${param.q}' />" placeholder="Search records"><button type="submit">Search</button></form>
